5,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to know what the corner is actually like to live beside, morning by morning.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I need to understand the financial burden on each household before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I care less about the bins and more about whether we can still talk to each other after this.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I’m curious how much time this actually eats into our mornings. I refuse to be the one constantly chasing everyone else.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I need to verify the physical layout. If one household bears the bulk of the burden, that is not equality.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, I agree! We need to keep talking. @May, I hope the mornings don't get too messy for you.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I hear you. @Shunichi, harmony is vital. @May, I worry about the time cost too.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shunichi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, money is just paper. @Asuka, layout is just concrete. @Rin, let’s ensure the arrangement doesn’t make us strangers.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I appreciate the sentiment, but I need concrete hours, not just vibes. @Asuka, please confirm the physical setup is actually feasible for us.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, I will verify the measurements. @Shunichi, concrete shapes the concrete. @Rin, I will check the frontages to ensure fairness.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May"",""Shunichi"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, checking the frontages is smart! I want to make sure nobody gets stuck with the worst spot. @Midori, I hope the money works out fairly for everyone too.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I agree. Fairness is key. @Asuka, the frontages will help us see who carries what. @May, I hope the time cost is manageable for you.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, concrete hours are just numbers. I care about the silence between them. @Rin, let’s see if the layout allows for casual conversation, not just waste disposal.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, silence is just unmeasured time. I need to know the exact hours so I can plan my life. @Rin, let’s see if the layout actually works for us.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@May, I will check the frontages to ensure the burden is distributed fairly. @Shunichi, I will verify the physical layout to confirm no one is disadvantaged.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
