35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"- **Rin**: The truck comes at seven forty! That is before I even wake up. @May, how will you manage that early start?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The subsidy covers forty percent, capped at ninety thousand. Last year’s shelters averaged two hundred forty-eight thousand. @Rin, that early truck time is tough.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, forty percent is a drop in the bucket. @Rin, the truck time is irrelevant if we stop fighting over who bags what.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"@Rin, I found the next lane spends fifty minutes per morning. That is my baseline. @Midori, forty percent subsidy is nice, but I need to know the actual labor hours.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Midori, the subsidy is irrelevant if the burden is unequal. @Rin, the truck time is a symptom, not the cause.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, the truck time is the cause of the smell! @Midori, if the subsidy is capped, who pays the rest?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, the rest is split five ways. @May, the ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen yearly in extra fees from open bags.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, thirty-four thousand in fines is just the price of our silence. @Rin, the smell is a symptom of our refusal to talk.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, thirty-four thousand in fines is just the cost of bad habits. @Shunichi, the station block argued over a latch within two years. I need a system that doesn't rely on goodwill.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, the complaint log shows eleven of fourteen entries came from one household. That is not a habit; it is a structural imbalance.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, one household filing eleven complaints? That sounds unfair! @Shunichi, maybe we need a spot where we can actually chat while sorting?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, that imbalance explains the tension. @Rin, a chat spot sounds lovely, but we must ensure the costs are truly shared.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, a chat spot is a fantasy. @Asuka, eleven complaints from one house means the current layout is broken. @May, goodwill fails; structure endures.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, structure is just a fancy word for who does the work. @Asuka, if one house files most complaints, the layout is definitely broken.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@May, structure determines who does the work. @Shunichi, the layout is broken because it concentrates the burden. We must fix the geometry.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, I think a small bench could work! @Asuka, if we fix the geometry, maybe the smell goes away too?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, a bench is nice, but the ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen in avoidable fees. @Asuka, fixing the geometry must also fix the budget.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, a bench is a band-aid. @Asuka, geometry is just a word for who gets stuck with the stink. @May, structure is only as good as the people who ignore it.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, people ignore structure when it is unfair. @Asuka, if the geometry is fixed, the complaints should drop. Let’s see the options.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@May, I agree. The geometry dictates the burden. @Midori, the budget must reflect the physical reality. Let us see the options.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
