68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, ignoring each other is exactly what I want. @Asuka, moving it just moves the mess. I am sticking with A.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, Option A leaves the burden static. @Shunichi, resentment is a symptom of unfair geometry. @Rin, Option B ensures no single household is permanently disadvantaged.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May"",""Shunichi"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I agree! If the bins move, the smell moves too. @May, but Option A means I have to wake up super early. I hate that!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
